      "prompt": "In E2, make the numbers 1 to 4 for ranks: =SEQUENCE(4).",
      "teach": "**SEQUENCE(n)** spills the numbers 1 to n down a column. `SEQUENCE(rows, columns, start, step)` can do more, like `SEQUENCE(5, 1, 2026)` for 2026 to 2030.",
